## 示例：完整注册流程

### 方式一：所有内容集中在 ExampleMod（适合小模组）

```java
@Mod(ExampleMod.MOD_ID)
public class ExampleMod {
    public static final String MOD_ID = "examplemod";
    private static final Logger LOGGER = LogUtils.getLogger();

    // 在 mod 构造函数中注册到事件总线
    public ExampleMod() {
        MinecraftForge.EVENT_BUS.register(this);
    }

    @SubscribeEvent
    public void onRegistry(RegistryEvent.Register<Block> event) {
        event.getRegistry().register(
            new Block(BlockBehaviour.Properties.of(Material.STONE)
                .strength(1.5f, 6.0f)
                .requiresCorrectToolForDrops()
            ).setRegistryName(new ResourceLocation(MOD_ID, "my_block"))
        );
    }

    @SubscribeEvent
    public void onItemRegistry(RegistryEvent.Register<Item> event) {
        // 注册方块物品
        event.getRegistry().register(
            new BlockItem(ExampleMod.MY_BLOCK.get(),
                new Item.Properties()
            ).setRegistryName(new ResourceLocation(MOD_ID, "my_block"))
        );

        // 注册普通物品
        event.getRegistry().register(
            new Item(new Item.Properties()
                .stacksTo(64)
            ).setRegistryName(new ResourceLocation(MOD_ID, "my_item"))
        );
    }

    @SubscribeEvent
    public void onBlockEntityRegistry(RegistryEvent.Register<BlockEntityType<?>> event) {
        event.getRegistry().register(
            BlockEntityType.Builder.of(MyBlockEntity::new, ExampleMod.MY_BLOCK.get())
                .build(null)
                .setRegistryName(new ResourceLocation(MOD_ID, "my_block_entity"))
        );
    }

    @SubscribeEvent
    public void onServerStarting(ServerStartingEvent event) {
        LOGGER.info("Server starting: {}", event.getServer().getWorldData().getLevelName());
    }
}
```

### 方式二：分散到多个注册类（推荐，适合中大型模组）

```java
// com/example/mod/registry/ModBlocks.java
public class ModBlocks {
    private ModBlocks() {}  // 工具类，禁止实例化

    public static Block MY_BLOCK;

    @SubscribeEvent
    public static void register(RegistryEvent.Register<Block> event) {
        MY_BLOCK = new Block(BlockBehaviour.Properties.of(Material.STONE)
            .strength(1.5f, 6.0f)
            .requiresCorrectToolForDrops()
        );
        MY_BLOCK.setRegistryName(new ResourceLocation(ExampleMod.MOD_ID, "my_block"));
        event.getRegistry().register(MY_BLOCK);
    }
}
```

```java
// com/example/mod/registry/ModItems.java
public class ModItems {
    private ModItems() {}

    public static Item MY_BLOCK_ITEM;
    public static Item MY_ITEM;

    @SubscribeEvent
    public static void register(RegistryEvent.Register<Item> event) {
        // BlockItem 与方块同名注册
        MY_BLOCK_ITEM = new BlockItem(ModBlocks.MY_BLOCK, new Item.Properties());
        MY_BLOCK_ITEM.setRegistryName(new ResourceLocation(ExampleMod.MOD_ID, "my_block"));
        event.getRegistry().register(MY_BLOCK_ITEM);

        // 普通物品
        MY_ITEM = new Item(new Item.Properties());
        MY_ITEM.setRegistryName(new ResourceLocation(ExampleMod.MOD_ID, "my_item"));
        event.getRegistry().register(MY_ITEM);
    }
}
```

```java
// com/example/mod/ExampleMod.java
@Mod(ExampleMod.MOD_ID)
public class ExampleMod {
    public static final String MOD_ID = "examplemod";

    public ExampleMod() {
        MinecraftForge.EVENT_BUS.register(this);
        MinecraftForge.EVENT_BUS.register(new ModBlocks());
        MinecraftForge.EVENT_BUS.register(new ModItems());
    }
}
```

> 注意：
> - 使用 `setRegistryName()` 确保 registry name 与 mods.toml 一致
> - BlockItem 与方块使用相同 registry name，Forge 自动关联
> - 注册顺序很重要：Block → BlockEntityType → Item

